<div class="container prose" style="max-width: 52rem;">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

  <h2>Data controller</h2>
  <p>Notre Demain — <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>

  <h2>Data collected</h2>
  <p>When you submit the contact form, we collect: your name, email address, the reason for your contact, and your message.</p>

  <h2>Purpose and legal basis</h2>
  <p>Your data is used solely to respond to your message. The legal basis is your explicit consent (checkbox on the form).</p>

  <h2>Processors</h2>
  <p>Form submissions are processed by <strong>Netlify</strong> (hosting and form service). No data is sold or shared with third parties.</p>

  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>Your data is kept for a maximum of 12 months, then deleted.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You have the right to access, correct or delete your data. To exercise these rights, write to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This site uses no tracking cookies. No cookie banner is required.</p>
